	(text_box "COIL TURN-OFF PROTECTION - D301 (1N4148W) in series with D302 (18V, 1W Zener)\n\nWhen Q301 switches off, the coil current needs a path to not damage Q301\n\nOmron recommends diode + Zener for this relay (datasheet precaution 14)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
