	(text_box "COIL DRIVER - constant-current sink: Q301 (BCP56-16), Q302 (BC847B), R301(8.2 ohm)\n\nHolds the coil current at 78mA regardless of the 9-17V supply without exceeding coil rating. \n\nQ302 turns Q301 down as soon as the voltage across R301 reaches its VBE.\n\nCoil current: I = VBE(Q302) / R301 = 0.64V / 8.2ohm = 78 mA\n\nR303 (10k): holds Q301 off if RELAY_EN is unpowered or floating, so the relay stays open.\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 82.9421 0)
		(size 73.66 28.8179)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
